## Implementation-spec conformance

- Navigation entry         : ShellWindow.xaml.cs PageFactory.Register("BatteryHealth", …) wiring NavigationRequested→NavigateTo;
                             route pre-existing in RouteTable.cs L105 (visible /battery) + L106 (hidden battery/health alias).
- Page scaffold            : BatteryHealthPage : UserControl + BatteryHealthPageViewModel : INotifyPropertyChanged
                             (LoadAsync/RefreshAsync, NotifyOpened); no business logic in the view (thin renderer; the VM
                             owns all state and re-projection, marshalled to the UI thread).
- Panels via design tokens : DisplayTokens.* brushes + TsGlassPanel (Mica/Acrylic glass) — no hardcoded colours; accents via
                             StatusResources.AccentBrushKey / token brush keys.
- 4 data states / source   : page-level loading/empty/error (TsSkeleton / TsEmptyState / TsQueryError) AND per-section empties
                             (insights / charge-dist / AC-DC pie / charging-stats render TsEmptyState; thermal cards + new-vs-now
                             range + capacity/range trends fall back to em-dash / no-data bodies) — never a blank region.
- i18n                     : every visible literal flows through ILocalizer (BatteryHealthStrings) with web key names; zero
                             hardcoded literals in the view; resw-backed with English fallback (sibling convention).
- a11y                     : AutomationProperties.SetName on the page, every gauge/card/bar/badge/insight/new-vs-now/stat-row/
                             quick-link; decorative FontIcons left to the panel name; TsChartContainer publishes an
                             AccessibleSummary (the chart aria strings); AutomationPeer reports Group.
- Units                    : SI converted only at the render boundary via UnitConverters/ScalarFormatters (°C→user temp with the
                             web's spread = ΔconvertedTemp identity; km*1000→metres→user distance; Wh→kWh for the breakdown);
                             ViewModel sources UnitPref; nothing non-SI stored/computed.
- Live data                : the thermal source (useChargingTelemetryLatest) is the page's live input; freshness is surfaced via
                             the header TsDataFreshness chip (UpdatedAt/IsFetching/IsError), consistent with the sibling W7 pages.

